 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 667007,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Consider the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Employee</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Developer</code> example above. What is the value of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dev_1.e_id</code>?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1329994,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "dev_1 is the second object to call Employee.__init__(). emp_1 is the first, so emp_1.e_id is 1."
    },
    {
     "id": 1329995,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dev_1</code> is the second <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Employee</code> created. So <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dev_1</code> is the second object to call <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Employee</code>.<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">__init__()</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dev_1.e_id</code> is assigned with <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1329996,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Error</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "dev_1 is created with Employee.__init__(), so dev_1 inherits the instance attributes e_id and hire_year."
    }
   ],
