     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dev_1</code> is the second <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Employee</code> created. So <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dev_1</code> is the second object to call <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">Employee</code>.<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">__init__()</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">dev_1.e_id</code> is assigned with <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code>."
